   "scope_status": "ok",
   "verified": true
  },
  {
   "location": "premise_checks[2].citations[1]",
   "doc": "REF",
   "page": 5,
   "quote": "NIR and Raman calibrations are specific to the matrix; after a change of sample matrix or composition the calibration must be re-validated (and usually rebuilt or extended) on the new material.",
   "claim_kind": "general",
   "quote_status": "not_found",
   "start": null,
   "end": null,
   "page_sha256": "81300b61100dacf73c80d9174685000d1ac439e5cf58f5286238bf9e3966cfef",
   "scope_status": "ok",
   "verified": false
  },
  {
   "location": "recommendations[0].citations[0]",
   "doc": "S01",
   "page": 16,
   "quote": "Raman is particularly well-suited for aqueous environments, as it exhibits low absorbance for water molecules compared to infrared methods.",
   "claim_kind": "general",
   "quote_status": "exact",
   "start": 1108,
   "end": 1247,
   "page_sha256": "9424664a2926166ba256e54a0843f7e6b4147c116c7721194758e253de93c27e",
   "scope_status": "ok",
   "verified": true
  },
  {
   "location": "recommendations[0].citations[1]",
   "doc": "S01",
   "page": 16,
   "quote": "Raman spectroscopy can be used in the same reactor to provide a \"molecular fingerprint\" for direct detection of specific metabolites like glucose, acetate, or lactate.",
   "claim_kind": "application_precedent",
   "quote_status": "exact",
   "start": 902,
   "end": 1069,
   "page_sha256": "9424664a2926166ba256e54a0843f7e6b4147c116c7721194758e253de93c27e",
   "scope_status": "ok",
   "verified": true
  },
  {
   "location": "recommendations[0].citations[2]",
   "doc": "S01",
   "page": 7,
   "quote": "The analysis of such systems may require a combination of two or even more spectral methods. This often provides a synergistic effect, allowing one to solve a problem that either method alone cannot handle or only partially.",
   "claim_kind": "method_gain",
   "quote_status": "exact",
   "start": 622,
   "end": 846,
